From: Daniel Mach <daniel.mach@suse.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jul 2024 10:36:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix possibility to overwrite special files in .osc
 (CVE-2024-22034 boo#1225911)

Origin: https://github.com/openSUSE/osc/commit/56c08df3d632a462a805be687336a8dfbbb1a4ab

Source files are now stored in the 'sources' subdirectory which prevents
name collisons. This requires changing version of '.osc' store to 2.0.
